{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/errata01/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "grype",
          "version": "0.99.1",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-58251-busybox",
              "name": "ApkMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-58251 low vulnerability for busybox package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In netstat in BusyBox through 1.37.0, local users can launch of network application with an argv[0] containing an ANSI terminal escape sequence, leading to a denial of service (terminal locked up) when netstat is used by a victim."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-58251\nSeverity: low\nPackage: busybox\nVersion: 1.36.1-r7\nFix Version: \nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2024-58251](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-58251)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-58251**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | busybox  | 1.36.1-r7  |   | apk  | /lib/apk/db/installed  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2024-58251](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-58251)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:apk/alpine/busybox@1.36.1-r7?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=alpine-3.18.12"
                ],
                "security-severity": "2.5"
              }
            },
